  "details": "Essential Info on normal nameplates:\n\n- PC/Android (For hosting world hopping events / dropping portals to worlds to make sure everyone present can join)\n\n- Join Status (For making sure everyone is on the correct status for the event)\n\n- Earmuff / Mute status\n\n- Pronouns\n\n- # of Mutuals if not a friend\n\n- Yellow name if friend ( This is amazing for finding your friends quickly in publics, even if they're not chatting)\n\nExtra Valuable Info on expanded nameplates (When you click on someone):\n\n- Status\n\n- Trust Rank\n\n- Age Verification\n\n- Group Name\n\n- Avatar Performance\n\nCONCEPT ART:\n\nI've drawn up some concept art below to illustrate what this could look like wth the above information on display. Obviously, things could be different, such as having only 1-2 lines for status or whatever.\n\nPlease comment on the essential information portion of this canny, not the concept art, thanks! <3",
